From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 06:45:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] 3220 comdlg32: PrintDlgEx property sheet, IShellBrowser of
 the file dialog, CF_SELECTSCRIPT, CDM_SETDEFEXT, shortcuts, envelope pages

PrintDlgExW/A were PrintDlgW with a hook (FIXME semi-stub). They now show the
Print property sheet: General page (printer list, status, Print to file,
Preferences) with a child dialog in its lower portion (Page Range with All /
Current Page / Selection / Pages, Copies, Collate; the application's template
replaces it with PD_ENABLEPRINTTEMPLATE[HANDLE]), the application's property
pages after it (nStartPage), Print / Apply / Cancel with PD_RESULT_PRINT,
PD_RESULT_APPLY (Apply, then Cancel: the data at Apply) and PD_RESULT_CANCEL,
page range lists ("1,3,5-12") checked against nMinPage/nMaxPage and
nMaxPageRanges, PD_USEDEVMODECOPIESANDCOLLATE, PD_RETURNDC/IC. The callback
gets SetSite(IPrintDialogServices) (current DEVMODE, printer and port name),
SelectionChange, InitDone and HandleMessage for the child's messages (S_OK is
the result, IDABORT closes as a cancel).

The file dialog's IShellBrowser answers as documented instead of E_NOTIMPL
(GetControlWindow, GetViewStateStream, menus, status text, toolbar items,
accelerators). CF_SELECTSCRIPT lists only the fonts of lfCharSet and locks the
script box. CDM_SETDEFEXT sets the default extension. A shortcut chosen in an
Open dialog gives its target (a shortcut to a folder opens the folder) unless
OFN_NODEREFERENCELINKS. Page Setup sends WM_PSD_PAGESETUPDLG with the paper and
orientation and, for envelopes, WM_PSD_ENVSTAMPRECT / WM_PSD_YAFULLPAGERECT and
draws them.

CORE review: GetOpenFileName now resolves .lnk selections (both dialogs).
Gate fastcdlg (64+32, 99 checks), 16 mutants SG_MUTANT_CDLG_* caught.

